+# Wire Serialisation Format
+
+No recorded decision on wire serialisation format currently exists in this project.
+The portable format (Markdown with frontmatter plus SQLite) and export format (JSONL) are documented in `docs/format.md`, but no explicit decision has been recorded regarding how data is serialized for transmission over network boundaries or between processes.
